  "description": "TuGraph-DB is an open-source labeled property-graph database from Ant Group, written in C++ and used internally for financial risk and relationship workloads. It offers serializable ACID transactions, openCypher, full-text and secondary indexes, embedded graph algorithms and stored procedures in C++ or Python, and it held the LDBC SNB benchmark record in 2022. The 4.5 line added a Bolt-protocol cluster mode. Activity has slowed: the last release is 4.5.2 from March 2025 and 2026 commits are documentation only, so evaluate support options before adopting it.",
